    [5266]={name="Eye of Adaegus",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 47-73.",zone="Azshara"},
    [5274]={name="Rose Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Morganth'. Starts with Theocritus in Redridge Mountains. Objective: Defeat Morganth.Bring his Pendant of Shadow to Theocritus at the Tower of Azora in Elwynn Forest.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Morganth",lore="After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."},
    [5275]={name="Binding Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Disruption Ends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thork in The Barrens. Objective: Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.Then bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5279]={name="Harpy Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Darsok Swiftdagger in The Barrens. Objective: Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5299]={name="Gloves of the Moon",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk'. Starts with Jorn Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5306]={name="Wind Rider Staff",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jorn Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5310]={name="Sea Dog Britches",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Guns of Northwatch'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun in The Barrens. Objective: Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun of Ratchet wants you to collect 10 Theramore Medals and slay Captain Fairmount, Cannoneer Whessan and Cannoneer Smythe.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Guns of Northwatch",lore="Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."},
    [5311]={name="Buckled Boots",quality=2,ilvl=21,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free From the Hold'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gilthares Firebough in The Barrens. Objective: Safely escort Gilthares Firebough back to Captain Brightsun in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Free From the Hold",lore="Finally! Someone to rescue me! I can't believe you got past the guards. These zealots from Theramore are out of their minds. They sank our ship and imprisoned me, the only survivor."},
    [5313]={name="Totemic Clan Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Revenge of Gann'. Starts with Gann Stonespire in The Barrens. Objective: Destroy the flying machine at Bael Modan and return to Gann Stonespire.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Revenge of Gann",lore="Following Khazgorm's plans it should be no problem to fashion an explosive charge Ah, there we go. Now, I am going to entrust you with a special task."},
    [5314]={name="Boar Hunter's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Consumed by Hatred'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mankrik in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 60 Bristleback Quilboar Tusks to Mankrik at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Consumed by Hatred",lore="Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."},
    [5315]={name="Timberland Armguards",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Murkdeep!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [5316]={name="Barkshell Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Betrayal from Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mangletooth in The Barrens. Objective: Bring Lok's Skull to Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Betrayal from Within",lore="Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."},
    [5317]={name="Dry Moss Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Betrayal from Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mangletooth in The Barrens. Objective: Bring Lok's Skull to Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Betrayal from Within",lore="Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",quality=1,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof.",zone="Loch Modan",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5322]={name="Demolition Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Choice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tatternack Steelforge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring a Razormane Backstabber, a Charred Razormane Wand and a Razormane War Shield to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Weapons of Choice",lore="The Razormane quilboars to the south, beyond the Field of Giants, have no skilled blacksmiths from what I am told, but they've apparently started to develop sturdier weapons."},
    [5323]={name="Everglow Lantern",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=19,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Choice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tatternack Steelforge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring a Razormane Backstabber, a Charred Razormane Wand and a Razormane War Shield to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Weapons of Choice",lore="The Razormane quilboars to the south, beyond the Field of Giants, have no skilled blacksmiths from what I am told, but they've apparently started to develop sturdier weapons.",proc="Use: Heal your target for 135 to 165. (30 Min Cooldown)"},
    [5327]={name="Greasy Tinker's Pants",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Escape'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Wizzlecrank's Shredder in The Barrens. Objective: Protect Wizzlecrank and the stolen goblin shredder on the way to Sputtervalve in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5337]={name="Wayfaring Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Booty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazlowe in The Barrens. Objective: Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5340]={name="Cauldron Stirrer",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Apothecary Zamah'. Starts with Apothecary Helbrim in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring the Rendered Spores to Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff, before the time limit is up.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Apothecary Zamah",lore="I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."},
    [5341]={name="Spore-covered Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Root Samples'. Starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 8 Root Samples to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Root Samples",lore="The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands. Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different."},
    [5343]={name="Barkeeper's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Raptor Horns'. Starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in The Barrens. Objective: Gather 5 Intact Raptor Horns from Sunscale Scytheclaws, and bring them to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Raptor Horns",lore="The raptors of the Barrens are smarter than raptors in other lands. And I think all that smarts is hiding in their horns!"},
    [5345]={name="Stonewood Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hezrul Bloodmark'. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring Hezrul's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5355]={name="Beastmaster's Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Isha Awak'. Starts with Mahren Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Heart of Isha Awak to Mahren Skyseer.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5404]={name="Serpent's Shoulders",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lady Anacondra.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lady Anacondra"},
    [5419]={name="Feral Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twisted Hatred'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tallonkai Swiftroot in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 8 Befouled Webwoods and bring Xethorr the Wicked's Mature Fel Moss to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Twisted Hatred",lore="I must warn you, this matter must stay between us. The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home."},
    [5420]={name="Banshee Armor",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Demon Seed'. Starts with Ak'Zeloth in The Barrens. Objective: Grab a Flawed Power Stone. Bring it to the Altar of Fire before the stone expires, then return to Ak'Zeloth.",zone="Durotar",questName="The Demon Seed",lore="The Demon Seed is a powerful tool for the Burning Legion. It rests in a cave on Dreadmist Peak, above a demonic altar of fire. I have prepared power stones that when placed near the Seed will disrupt its connection to the Legion."},
    [5422]={name="Brambleweed Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Boahn.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Boahn"},
    [5444]={name="Miner's Cape",quality=3,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Miner Johnson.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Miner Johnson"},
    [5540]={name="Pearl-handled Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 85).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [5541]={name="Iridescent Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 140). The Blacksmithing pattern is the drop.",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [5542]={name="Pearl-clasped Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 70).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5587]={name="Thornroot Club",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ursal the Mauler'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Athridas Bearmantle in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill Ursal the Mauler and return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Ursal the Mauler",lore="Now the time has come to save the Druids of the Talon. If we fail now, they will be forever lost in sleep. I shall prepare the Relics of Wakening and perform the ritual."},
    [5609]={name="Steadfast Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Escape Through Force'. Starts with Volcor in Darkshore. Objective: Protect Volcor until you reach the road, then speak to Terenthis in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Escape Through Force",lore="All right, force it is. Let's get out of here as soon as you're ready. We'll fight our way down to the road--Grimclaw should still be there."},
    [5610]={name="Gustweald Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cave Mushrooms'. Starts with Barithras Moonshade in Darkshore. Objective: Bring 5 Scaber Stalks and 1 Death Cap to Barithras Moonshade in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Cave Mushrooms",lore="I am devising a potion that requires rare mushrooms, mushrooms that grow only in a certain cave. The cave lies behind Cliffspring Falls, to the east and slightly north along the mountains."},
    [5611]={name="Tear of Grief",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'For Love Eternal'.",zone="Darkshore",questName="For Love Eternal",lore="In the aftermath of the battles at the Well of Eternity, I heard that Ameth'Aran had been destroyed, its people dead, including my love, Anaya."},
    [5612]={name="Ivy Cuffs",quality=1,ilvl=13,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tools of the Highborne'. Starts with Thundris Windweaver in Darkshore. Objective: Retrieve 7 Highborne Relics for Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Tools of the Highborne",lore=". A task I would ask of you. Have you seen the ruins of Ameth'Aran? If not, you will find them on the eastern side of the main road, some ways to the south."},
    [5613]={name="Staff of the Purifier",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balthule Shadowstrike in Ashenvale. Objective: Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale.",proc="Use: Purifies the friendly target, removing 1 disease effect and 1 poison effect. (5 Min Cooldown)"},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Asterion in Darkshore. Objective: Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5622]={name="Clergy Ring",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balthule Shadowstrike in Ashenvale. Objective: Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale."},
    [5627]={name="Relic Blade",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."},
    [5629]={name="Hammerfist Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [5630]={name="Windfelt Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [5743]={name="Prismstone Ring",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=35,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Geomancer Flintdagger.",zone="Uldaman",npc="Geomancer Flintdagger"},
    [5751]={name="Webwing Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Pridewing Patriarch.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",npc="Pridewing Patriarch"},
    [5752]={name="Wyvern Tailspike",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Pridewing Patriarch.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",npc="Pridewing Patriarch",proc="Chance on hit: Poisons target for 6 Nature damage every 3 sec for 15 sec."},
    [5753]={name="Ruffled Chaplet",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Terrowulf Packlord.",zone="Ashenvale",npc="Terrowulf Packlord"},
    [5754]={name="Wolfpack Medallion",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Terrowulf Packlord.",zone="Ashenvale",npc="Terrowulf Packlord"},
    [5756]={name="Sliverblade",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=32,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Herod.",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 63 Frost damage."},
    [5757]={name="Hardwood Cudgel",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mathystra Relics'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Onu in Darkshore. Objective: Bring 6 Mathystra Relics to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Mathystra Relics",lore="The parchment you found at the Master's Glaive is a page from an ancient text...written by elves!"},
    [5766]={name="Lesser Wizard's Robe",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 110).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5770]={name="Robes of Arcana",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 125). The Tailoring pattern drops from Defias Enchanter and Dark Strand Voidcaller.",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5780]={name="Murloc Scale Belt",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 65). Bought from Gina MacGregor, Andrew Hilbert, and Mavralyn.",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5781]={name="Murloc Scale Breastplate",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 70). Bought from Gina MacGregor, Andrew Hilbert, and Mavralyn.",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5782]={name="Thick Murloc Armor",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 145). Bought from Micha Yance, Christoph Jeffcoat, and Blixrez Goodstitch.",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5783]={name="Murloc Scale Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=33,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 165). Bought from Blixrez Goodstitch and Helenia Olden.",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5812]={name="Robes of Antiquity",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ruuzel'. Starts with Talen in Ashenvale. Objective: Bring the Ring of Zoram to Talen near the Zoram Strand.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Ruuzel",lore="I fear the ancient statuette's secrets will remain forever hidden unless you find the key to its ancient lock. That key is a ring, the Ring of Zoram."},
    [5814]={name="Snapbrook Armor",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Pelturas Whitemoon in Ashenvale. Objective: Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [5815]={name="Glacial Stone",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Raene's Cleansing'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Krolg in Ashenvale. Objective: Bring Ran Bloodtooth's Skull and Dartol's Rod of Transformation to Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Raene's Cleansing",lore="Return to your own tribe and let them know of your victory here. Show them your trophy, and bask in the glory...",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 75 Frost damage."},
    [5820]={name="Faerie Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Branch of Cenarius'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Anilia in Ashenvale. Objective: Kill Geltharis and return the Branch of Cenarius to Illiyana at the Shrine of Aessina.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="The Branch of Cenarius",lore="Anilia puts her hands on your shoulders and draws you close. Gasping, she points towards the arch to the north, before her eyes close and her last wheezing breath leaves her body."},
    [5957]={name="Handstitched Leather Vest",quality=2,ilvl=10,reqLevel=3,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 40).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5958]={name="Fine Leather Pants",quality=2,ilvl=21,reqLevel=16,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 80). The Leatherworking pattern is the drop.",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5961]={name="Dark Leather Pants",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 90).",profession="Leatherworking"},
