    [15396]={name="Curvewood Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fragments Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Darkshore. Objective: Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Fragments Within",lore="The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone."},
    [15397]={name="Oakthrush Staff",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fragments Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Darkshore. Objective: Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Fragments Within",lore="The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone."},
    [15399]={name="Dryweed Belt",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Washed Ashore'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Darkshore. Objective: Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Washed Ashore",lore="That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water."},
    [15403]={name="Ridgeback Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Murkdeep!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [15405]={name="Shucking Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fruit of the Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gubber Blump in Darkshore. Objective: Collect 6 Fine Crab Chunks for Gubber Blump in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Fruit of the Sea",lore="I love crab. Crabs are the fruit of the sea! You can bake it, barbecue it, boil it, and broil it. They're pan fried, deep fried, and stir fried."},
    [15411]={name="Mark of Fordring",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Dreams'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Highlord Taelan Fordring in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="In Dreams",lore="For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become?",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [15418]={name="Shimmering Platinum Warhammer",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Dreams'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Highlord Taelan Fordring in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="In Dreams",lore="For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become?",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 211 to 293 Nature damage."},
    [15421]={name="Shroud of the Exile",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Dreams'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Highlord Taelan Fordring in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="In Dreams",lore="For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become?"},
    [15431]={name="Peerless Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 38-61."},
    [15443]={name="Kris of Orgrimmar",quality=3,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15444]={name="Staff of Orgrimmar",quality=3,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15445]={name="Hammer of Orgrimmar",quality=3,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15449]={name="Ghastly Trousers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Power to Destroy...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Varimathras in Undercity. Objective: Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15450]={name="Dredgemire Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Power to Destroy...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Varimathras in Undercity. Objective: Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15452]={name="Featherbead Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Returning the Lost Satchel'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Grimtotem in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15453]={name="Savannah Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Returning the Lost Satchel'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Grimtotem in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15455]={name="Dustfall Robes",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hints of a New Plague?'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quae in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Find Phin Odelic in Southshore.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15456]={name="Lightstep Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hints of a New Plague?'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quae in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Find Phin Odelic in Southshore.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15457]={name="Desert Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimtotem Spying'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Thousand Needles. Objective: Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15458]={name="Tundra Boots",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimtotem Spying'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Thousand Needles. Objective: Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15461]={name="Lightheel Boots",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protect Kanati Greycloud'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15462]={name="Loamflake Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protect Kanati Greycloud'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15464]={name="Brute Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arikara'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magatha Grimtotem in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arikara. Bring her remains and the Incendia powder to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post as proof of your deed.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Arikara",lore="Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead."},
    [15468]={name="Windsong Drape",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free at Last'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lakota Windsong in Thousand Needles. Objective: Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15469]={name="Windsong Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free at Last'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lakota Windsong in Thousand Needles. Objective: Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15471]={name="Brawnhide Armor",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem",lore="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."},
    [15501]={name="Outrunner's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=12,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 11-18."},
    [15508]={name="Grunt's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 14-20."},
    [15519]={name="Spiked Chain Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 18-24."},
    [15526]={name="Sentry's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 19-26."},
    [15559]={name="Pillager's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 26-32.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",zoneOpen=true},
    [15587]={name="Ringtail Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Clam Bait'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mai'Lahii in Desolace. Objective: Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Clam Bait",lore="You have the look of a fisherman! I love to fish - been fishing all my life. The best bait to use is soft-shelled clam meat; the fish just can't resist, you know what I mean?"},
    [15594]={name="Steadfast Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=32,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 32-39."},
    [15661]={name="Impenetrable Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 48-55."},
    [15689]={name="Trader's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bodyguard for Hire'.",zone="Desolace",questName="Bodyguard for Hire",lore="Under normal circumstances, Rigger and I would lead our kodo past the Kolkar Centaur. Every now and then we hear the Centaur war drums, and when we hear those we stop."},
    [15690]={name="Kodobone Necklace",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bone Collector'.",zone="Desolace",questName="Bone Collector",lore="We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine! Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them."},
    [15697]={name="Kodo Rustler Boots",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kodo Roundup'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Smeed Scrabblescrew in Desolace. Objective: Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp.",zone="Desolace",questName="Kodo Roundup",lore="Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me. Ever since I learned how to rejuvenate and control aged and dying kodos with my kodo kombobulator, the caravan owner Cork, Rigger, and I entered a partnership."},
    [15702]={name="Chemist's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Melding of Influences'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chemist Fuely in Undercity. Objective: Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Melding of Influences",lore="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."},
    [15703]={name="Chemist's Smock",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Melding of Influences'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chemist Fuely in Undercity. Objective: Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Melding of Influences",lore="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."},
    [15704]={name="Hunter's Insignia Medal",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Past Endeavors'. The quest is in Winterspring. Objective: Bring Storm Shadowhoof's Marker to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Past Endeavors",lore="Before you spoke to me, I had heard of your endeavors... that you had an unyielding desire to prove yourself, that you had an exceptional ability as a, and I now know these things to be the truth."},
    [15707]={name="Brantwood Sash",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Final Blow'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. Objective: Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15708]={name="Blight Leather Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Final Blow'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. Objective: Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15786]={name="Fernpulse Jerkin",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'High Chief Winterfall'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.",zone="Winterspring",questName="High Chief Winterfall",lore="While we still know very little about why the furbolg have been ingesting this strange substance, I do think it's best that we put a stop to it before it gets out of hand."},
    [15789]={name="Deep River Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Strange Sources'. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Strange Sources",lore="To tell you the truth, although there are no volcanoes here in Winterspring, I believe that there are far more threatening reasons for these hot springs..."},
    [15799]={name="Heroic Commendation Medal",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mission Accomplished!'. Starts with High Executor Derrington in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Mission Accomplished!"},
    [15802]={name="Mooncloth Boots",quality=3,ilvl=56,reqLevel=51,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 285).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [15804]={name="Cerise Drape",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glyphed Oaken Branch'. Starts with Mulgris Deepriver in Darnassus. Objective: Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Glyphed Oaken Branch",lore="The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark."},
    [15805]={name="Penelope's Rose",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kirtonos the Herald'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eva Sarkhoff in Scholomance. Objective: Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff.",zone="Scholomance",questName="Kirtonos the Herald",lore="This is it. The blood of innocents. The purest blood, used to appease Krastinov's master. It is with this blood that Kirtonos may be summoned."},
    [15811]={name="Heavy Spear",quality=1,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gunther Weller in Stormwind (Alliance) or Francis Eliot in Undercity (Horde).",zone="Undercity",npc="Francis Eliot"},
    [15822]={name="Shadowskin Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Runecloth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Meilosh in Felwood. Objective: Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",zone="Felwood",questName="Runecloth",lore="In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."},
    [15824]={name="Astoria Robes",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Put Her Down'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Helendis Riverhorn in Blackrock Spire. Objective: Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Put Her Down",lore="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command. It is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle."},
    [15825]={name="Traphook Jerkin",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Put Her Down'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Helendis Riverhorn in Blackrock Spire. Objective: Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Put Her Down",lore="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command. It is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle."},
    [15854]={name="Dancing Sliver",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=57,sourceType="unsourced",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dawn's Gambit'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Scholomance",questName="Dawn's Gambit",lore="I've placed Dawn's Gambit in the container you brought to us, the one that held the dragon eggs. Your job is to bring it deep within the Scholomance."},
    [15855]={name="Ring of Protection",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Treasures'. Starts with Pamela Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
    [15856]={name="Archlight Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Treasures'. Starts with Pamela Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
    [15861]={name="Swiftfoot Treads",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Delivery to Ridgewell'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mayara Brightwing in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Delivery to Ridgewell",lore="I have packaged Doomriggers Clasp into a crate, suitable for shipment to Stormwind., you have been extremely helpful -- can I ask you for one last favor?"},
    [15863]={name="Grave Scepter",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Tinkee'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Return to Tinkee",lore="Ok, everything is prepared and packed and ready for transport! Good luck in your journey, and make sure you tell Tinkee that she owes me!"},
    [15864]={name="Condor Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=39,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ghost-o-plasm Round Up'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace. Objective: Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Ghost-o-plasm Round Up",lore="There's a valley to the southeast, the Valley of Bones, haunted by Magram ghosts. Sounds scary, doesn't it? Well think how scary it is to the Magram!"},
    [15866]={name="Veildust Medicine Bag",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Curing the Sick'. Starts with Alanndarian Nightsong in Moonglade. Objective: Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Deer that are located throughout Darkshore; doing so should cure them. Sickly Deer have been reported starting south of the Cliffspring River to the north of Auberdine and extending all the way into southern Darkshore where the edge of Ashenvale begins.",zone="Moonglade",questName="Curing the Sick",lore="The amount of salve made out of the reagents you brought me is good enough for ten doses. While I work with the village to try and make some more salve, I'd like for you to help us get a head start.",proc="Use: Restores 50 mana every 3 sec for 15 sec. (30 Min Cooldown)"},
